  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010010,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あ……おはよ～、プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうしたんだ？\r\n元気がないじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "はぁ……プロデューサー、\r\nちょっと聞いてくれん？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんだ、なんでも相談してくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん……今朝ね、昨日の夜に作ったカレー食べようと思って\r\n炊飯器開けたら……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……開けたら？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "タイマー入れ忘れててご飯炊けてなかったんよ～\r\nああ～、二日目のカレー楽しみにしとったのに～……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うーん、それは災難だったな、恋鐘",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ええ～、それだけ～！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちの気持ち、伝わらんと～？\r\nカレーは一晩寝かすと美味しくなるの知らんの！？",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは確かにそうかもな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そうばい！\r\nプロデューサー、わかってくれたと？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん。なんか、腹が減ってきたよ\r\nそれで……代わりに何か食べてきたのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ううん、今日は時間もなかったけん\r\nなんも食べとらんよ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "はぁ……お腹空いた～……\r\nもうダメ……一歩も動けんばい～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、わかったわかった\r\nじゃあ、コンビニのおにぎりだけど……ひとつどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ホント！？　でも……それプロデューサーの朝ご飯やろ？\r\nお腹空かん？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫だ。つい、何個も買っちゃったんだよな\r\n……食べてくれるとありがたいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "やった～！　ありがと～、プロデューサー！\r\nこの恩は一生忘れんけんね～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大袈裟だな。じゃあ、恋鐘はどれがいい？\r\n先に選んでいいぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "いやいや～、うちは後でよかよ\r\nなんでも好きやけん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいのか？　じゃあ……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "鮭にしようかな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "梅、いいか？",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "ツナマヨかなぁ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010130,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "鮭か～じゃあうちは……イクラ！\r\nこれ貰ってよかと？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、いいぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010140,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～、ありがと～！\r\nやっぱり鮭の相方といえばイクラやけんね～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010150,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "鶏といえば卵！　鮭といえばイクラ！\r\nプロデューサーといえばうち！　みたいな！",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "んー、鮭とイクラか……\r\nどっちかっていうと親子ってことにならないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふえっ！？\r\nた、確かにそうとも言うたい……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘が、娘かぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "だっ……\r\nそ、それはダメばい！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、すまん\r\nそんなの恋鐘がイヤだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そ、そげん意味やなくて！\r\nえっとぉ……う～ん……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "う、うちとプロデューサーは\r\n最強のコンビにならんといかんばい……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？\r\nああ、恋鐘のこと、全力でサポートするよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "イクラ、ほら\r\n食べてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010200,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "プ、プロデューサー……！\r\nそげん意味じゃなかばってん……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010210,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……ばってん、ありがとう\r\nうち、おにぎりパワーでば～り頑張るばい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ！　よろしく頼むぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010220,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "じゃあ、いっただきま～す！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010230,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "梅か～、しょっぱいしすっぱいけん\r\n目が覚めてよかね！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010240,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ん～……！　梅もよか～！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘が食べてもいいんだぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010250,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "よ、よかと～！？\r\nじゃあ、遠慮せんよ～？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010260,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～、いっただっき──\r\n──あ、半分こ、せん？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……え？　半分こって……\r\nおにぎりを？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010270,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そうばい！　うち、お腹が減りすぎとったけん、\r\n自分が食べることば～っか、考えとったと",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010280,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そんじゃ……はい！　プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、おう！　ありがとう。……あれ\r\nなんか、梅がほとんどこっちに来ちゃったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010290,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ああ～よかよ！\r\nプロデューサーにあげるばい",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "嬉しいけど……悪いよ\r\n……交換しようか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010300,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そんなん、よかよ～！\r\n一緒に『すっぱい～！』ってならんね！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010310,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ほら、早く～早く～\r\nいただきま～す……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010320,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ツナマヨか～、\r\nコンビニのおにぎりといえばこれやね！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ツナマヨがよかったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010330,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ううん、うちが狙っとったとはこっちばい！\r\n牛カルビ焼肉！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、恋鐘は肉が好きだもんなー\r\nでも、食べたいのがあるなら、言ってくれればよかったのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010340,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちの好みば、知ってくれとーったいね～\r\nじゃあ、わざわざ残してくれとったと？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、まぁ……\r\n確かに、焼肉以外にしようかとは思ってたけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010350,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ホント！\r\nいやープロデューサー、うちへの愛に満ち溢れとるね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400401/2004004010350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004010360,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "え……そ、そうなん？",
